# Tooling, agent and local-analysis leftovers. These are gitignored, but they SURVIVE a
# `git checkout --force` on the deploy path, and the build context there is the PARENT directory — so
# without these the daemon is sent hundreds of megabytes of unrelated files. Measured on the audit
# machine: scratch/ 352.8 MB, .zvec-grep/ 116.4 MB, .antigravity/ 81.7 MB, graphify-out/ 64.5 MB,
# .kilo/ 49.0 MB, coverage/ 16.7 MB.
scratch
.zvec-grep
.antigravity
graphify-out
.kilo
.gemini
graft
coverage
temp_jobs
